title: "SPM-Kit — open AFM/SPM analysis engine and Fathom workspace"
abstract: "Open-source AFM/SPM numerical analysis engine and graphical workspace. Selected Sa, Sq and Sz claims have limited LEVEL 3 cross-validation against Gwyddion 2.71. Independently designed and developed by José Labarca Baeza in the academic context of the SPM Lab at Universidad Técnica Federico Santa María."
